The exercises solved here, the worked examples followed, and the methods used
all come from the book

    Julian J. Faraway, "Linear Models with R",
    Chapman & Hall/CRC (CRC Press, Taylor & Francis Group),
    Texts in Statistical Science series.

All credit for the problems, the examples and the teaching material belongs to
the author, Julian J. Faraway, and to the publisher, Chapman & Hall/CRC. This
repository is only a personal set of solutions written while studying the book.
It is not affiliated with, and is not endorsed by, the author or the publisher.
Please buy or borrow the book to read the full material.


WHAT THE DEDICATION DOES NOT COVER
----------------------------------

- The book itself: its text, exercise statements, examples and figures remain
